## Symptom

B297 truncation is inconsistently applied: last_error_detail is stored UNTRUNCATED (summarize_pass_errors puts raw pe_detail into last_error.err_detail and the writer emits it raw at c2c_relay_connector.ml:1308-1311); only the summary array detail and printed lines truncate. Detail strings are full relay response JSON (can embed PoW challenges), so the state file can carry multi-KB lines that doctor renders unclipped - the exact symptom the 240-char cap was meant to remove.

## Fix direction

Truncate at construction in summarize_pass_errors.

